    "source": "Reference markup posted by Aryan in #fortel 27 Aug 2026 01:06 IST, Drive id 1lSEIYvQnYSVmLsIU7GJi9B56iN2pfXBy, as 'it should be like' for the 092 Mezzanine sheet, which currently produces NO markups. Labels on it read 'Unclassified area - 1,202.40 m2', 'Cut-out 1 - 8.47 m2', 'Cut-out 2 - 9.61 m2'. Kept at ~/fortel-ground-truth/, OUT of drawings/, because the robustness corpus scans that tree.",
    "corroboration": "geometry.measure_regions on these 19 vertices at k=0.070031 returns exactly 1202.40 m2, matching the markup label to +0.00%, which corroborates both the polygon and the derived scale. Driving Aryan's measure_regions_with_cutouts (53bd6b8) with cutouts of the labelled sizes returns net 1,184.30 against the label's 1,184.32.",
    "note": "SOURCE SHEET NOT HELD LOCALLY \u2014 only this markup. Re-extract the unmarked sheet from the project-7 pack (Drive 17oWqg4aulX7dQUbtHtpEnSvfrsIsyZwR) before measuring; the markup overlay occludes what is beneath it, as proved on the MJM 9000 sheet."
